      "desc:8": "[note]Modularized machines[/note]\nTST's modularized machines (Plasma Forge MK-II, Large Neutron Oscillator, Indistinct Tentacle MK-II, Mass Fabricator Genesis, Strange Matter Aggregator...) take module hatches. Execution cores run the recipes; parallel, speed, power and overclock modules change how. Place them in the hatch positions shown in the structure preview.\n\nStatic and dynamic parallel modules, T1 (UV) to T8. Static ones add a fixed parallel; dynamic ones (made from a static one with a screen and a data orb) can be tuned.\n\nAny one of these completes the quest.",
